{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1140366-i-did-a-thing","id":1140366,"title":"I did a thing.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-14T17:51:17-07:00","id":1140366,"title":"I did a thing.","content":"Tried to write up a version of Keepers of the Covenant. It ended up being Acanthus with Spirit primary since the original version didn't seem to really do anything with Fate. Anyway, here you go.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Keepers of the Covenant</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Background: Members of the Keepers are commonly drawn from Mages who have an animistic view of the world, and who aren\u2019t adverse to permanently tying their destiny to the Shadow. This usually means drawing from shamanistic cultures, or even Voodoo or Shinto priesthoods, but it isn\u2019t exclusive. It\u2019s actually become less exclusive since the Great Assembly that happened in the 20th century, though the reasons behind their recruiting success seem to be purposely occluded.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Appearance: Keepers tend to dress for the crowd they\u2019re going to interact with, bright warm colors for a local court of fire spirits, or a hoodie for the spirit being powered by the Essence a gang generates or the gang itself. They tend to prioritize finding a spirit to deal with over interacting with people, especially if the spirit might make dealing with a group of people easier.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Prerequisites: Initiation, 2nd: Spirit 2, Socialize 3, 3rd: Spirit 3, In </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">addition to Socialize 3 the Keeper must increase </span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">another Legacy related skill to 3 or a third to 2, 4th: Spirit 4, Socialize 4 and other skill requirements of previous attainments, 5th: Spirit 5, Must attain 3 dots in the secondary Legacy related skill or 2 dots in a third Legacy related skill. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Other legacy skills: Politics, Persuasion, Empathy, Streetwise</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Initiation: To find and make a pact with a spirit designated by the mentor.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Organizations: Spirits are organized into ranks and courts and Keepers aren\u2019t really any different considering their close association with the Shadow. They consider themselves to be one Court, anyone of a lower rank must obey. Those of lower rank are always seeking an advantage to rise above, peers tend to be adversarial. The Mentor/Student relationship trumps any other considerations, but it\u2019s not uncommon for a Student who reaches a certain level to seek a Mentor who can afford a better advantage.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Theory: The theory is that transcendental truth can be discovered in the Shadow, but the attempts to find it are obfuscated by chaotic interaction of the Shadow with the Fallen. Keepers exist to create a kind of order behind or through which the deeper Mysteries can be plumbed. They also serve as a needed intermediary between the Fallen and the Spirit without which one could easily subsume the other doing permanent damage to the Tellurian.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ruling Arcanum: Spirit</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Yantras: Succeeding on a Socialize roll relevant to the spell +2, striking a verbal bargain with a spirit +1, allowing themselves to fall under a power (Influence or Numina) of a spirit +2, casting a spell within the vicinity of a locus +1</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Oblations: Performing a rite meant to appease or empower a spirit nonmagically, meditating in the presence of a locus, assembling the key to a Verge via non-magical means, having a meaningful interaction with a spriit.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attainments</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">First: Oath of Synthesis </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Exorcists Eye)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Instant Activation</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Read the Intentions a spirit has for a scene, Instant Activation, Sensory Range.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Second: Know Spirit</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Instant, Sensory range, Dice penalty apply to potency</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Shifting the odds, Instant, Advanced duration, found in 1 hour, only works on spirit related phenomena.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Third: Emissary of the Pact </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Channel essence)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Instant, sensory</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Sworn Oath, Combine cast with Channel Essence: Instant Activation, Advanced duration, know if the Boon has changed to a Hex, only applies to spirits</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fourth: Familiar</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Advanced duration</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Oaths Fulfilled, only works on Spirits, Instant, Advanced Duration, Sensory Range, Able to track the subject of the spell for the Duration and also receive a vision of them fulfilling the objective.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fifth: Eidolon of Union (</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Place of Power)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Instant Activation, Advanced Duration, Reach spent to change Gauntlet strength independently, and dice penalties applied to Duration to make it last a week.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Optional: Chaos Mastery, Combined Cast with Place of Power: Switched Primary Factor, Advanced Scale, lasts a week.</span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 09-14-2017, 08:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T18:01:18-07:00","id":1140372,"title":"","content":"One curious thing - why Acanthus?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-14T18:38:37-07:00","id":1140385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1140366-i-did-a-thing?p=1140372#post1140372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One curious thing - why Acanthus?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, the original legacy was Fate/Spirit with Fate being the primary arcana, but Fate didn't actually do anything at all except grant bonus dice to Spirit spells. Since in practice the legacy was actually Spirit primary I decided to run with that and use Fate as the Optional arcana instead. That would mean that the original creator of the legacy was almost certainly an Acanthus, and the Acanthus would be the most likely to delve into it. There's also the whole thing about a Keeper being someone who has bound his fate to the Shadow, which seems like a very Acanthus thing to do. It also stays sort of subtle and indirect as I tend to think Acanthus are while opening up more options than just laying in a Boon or Hex.<br /> <br /> I actually have a rougher write up of a Fate primary, Spirit optional legacy as well. I wasn't specifically thinking of Keepers of the Covenant when I helped write it up though, but it might serve as a decent alternative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T02:59:49-07:00","id":1140467,"title":"","content":"Hmm... I should add the Elders to my To-Do List for my homebrew. I wish I could say let's compare notes, but sadly life keeps me busy. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, one last piece of input on your otherwise fine work - any ideas on how to fit Conditional Duration in there in any way, since that's what an Acanthus would come up with when making pacts and covenants?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T03:47:40-07:00","id":1140476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1140366-i-did-a-thing?p=1140467#post1140467\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm... I should add the Elders to my To-Do List for my homebrew. I wish I could say let's compare notes, but sadly life keeps me busy. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, one last piece of input on your otherwise fine work - any ideas on how to fit Conditional Duration in there in any way, since that's what an Acanthus would come up with when making pacts and covenants?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it would just be adding a mana cost and setting the condition of ending the attainment to fulfilling the particulars of the bargain or oath.<br /> <br /> However, most of the attainments last a sufficiently long time that their activation costs are fairly trivial, and extending the Duration is as simple as re-activating the attainment before the original activation's time is up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T04:31:24-07:00","id":1140484,"title":"","content":"Oh, my interest wasn't in extending those Attainments' Durations. I was wondering if the Keepers having an augmented, gimmicky version of Conditional Duration sounds feasible. If such a thing could be crafted, that is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T04:36:36-07:00","id":1140485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1140366-i-did-a-thing?p=1140484#post1140484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, my interest wasn't in extending those Attainments' Durations. I was wondering if the Keepers having an augmented, gimmicky version of Conditional Duration sounds feasible. If such a thing could be crafted, that is.</div> </div> </div> </div>It might be, but what do you want it for exactly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T04:43:55-07:00","id":1140486,"title":"","content":"Cuz it sounded like what an Fate-wielding shaman would have in her repertoire?<br /> <br /> It's yet only a half-formed idea floating in my head, so feel free to brush it away if it doesn't fit with your idea for the Keepers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-15T05:21:07-07:00","id":1140488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1140366-i-did-a-thing?p=1140486#post1140486\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cuz it sounded like what an Fate-wielding shaman would have in her repertoire?<br /> <br /> It's yet only a half-formed idea floating in my head, so feel free to brush it away if it doesn't fit with your idea for the Keepers.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's more just that I don't see where it would fit in. Basically, what's the benefit?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}